  "archivedBody": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-64792f9ca4a89f237fb3438f\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a9032d95-ba0b-473e-a531-82cdd71f9f84_789/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a9032d95-ba0b-473e-a531-82cdd71f9f84_789/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"0977919d72303cde1fde\" id=\"block-0977919d72303cde1fde\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\"sqsrte-small\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><em>These poems were originally published at </em><a href=\"https://angryoldmanmagazine.net/michael-bagwell/\"><em>Angry Old Man</em></a> </p><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">6-15</h4><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">www.ww.www<br><br>double you double you double you dot<br>double you double you dot<br>double you double you double you dot<br><br>uuuuuu.<br>uuuu.<br>uuuuuu</p><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">6-20</h4><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">work<br>wkro<br>krow<br>wrok</p><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Reckless</h4><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">the<br>dens<br>ity<br>of<br>turning<br>back. The<br>breath that<br>wakes up<br>from a salt<br>dream but<br>not drowning<br>just remember<br>ing<br><br>reck<br>less<br>and<br>open<br>hearted<br>How<br>do they<br>even<br>make<br>something<br>so lone<br>ly so<br>alone<br><br>one<br>thing<br>is cer<br>tain, we<br>keep<br>missing<br>it</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-0977919d72303cde1fde {\n    \n    \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-0977919d72303cde1fde .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-0977919d72303cde1fde {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-0977919d72303cde1fde {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-0977919d72303cde1fde {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-0977919d72303cde1fde {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-0977919d72303cde1fde .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n    \n  </style>\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>",
